This page costs <Neon>640,000 database reads</Neon>.

For most of Tigris's life, a page like this was the single largest source of
expensive list traffic in our system. Object reads did not hold that title, and
neither did multipart uploads. A dashboard did.

This post explains why the page cost so much, and it walks through the cache
that fixed it. The cache itself is boring. The interesting part is proving
exactly how stale the answer can ever be.

